menu "ps_can (TWAI transport)"

    config PS_CAN_TX_GPIO
        int "Default CAN TX GPIO"
        default 4
        help
            Bench default for the single-controller nodes (1-6). The chest hub
            passes both controllers' pins explicitly from board_hub.h instead.

    config PS_CAN_RX_GPIO
        int "Default CAN RX GPIO"
        default 5

    config PS_CAN_BITRATE
        int "CAN bitrate (bit/s)"
        default 1000000
        help
            Contract value is 1 Mbps on both buses (docs/network-map.md §2).
            The bus load budget in §10 assumes it.

endmenu
